   "daf": "31b",
   "sentenceId": 17,
   "he": "הֶקְדֵּשׁ בֶּדֶק הַבַּיִת חָל עַל הַכֹּל. לְאֵיתוֹיֵי מַאי? אָמַר רָבִינָא: לְאֵיתוֹיֵי שִׁפּוּיֵי וְנִיבָא.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that «consecration for Temple maintenance takes effect on all» items. This emphasis indicates that it takes effect even on items that one might otherwise have thought are not consecrated. The Gemara asks: «What» does the mishna mean «to add» by this emphasis? «Ravina said:» It means «to add shavings and fallen leaves» of a tree that was consecrated for Temple maintenance."
  }
 ],
